# DainRaku OS — Base System Package List
# Desktop: KDE Plasma | Terminal: Ghostty | Browser: BrowserOS
# Kernel: Liquorix | Filesystem: BTRFS | Installer: Calamares
# NOTE: No games or entertainment packages are included.

